# `agents.permission_presets`

Permission presets for the agent-create wizard.

**Policy** — read (C0, safe). Capability `ship.agents.read`.

## Arguments

None.

## Returns

`PermissionPresetsResponse` (JSON).

| field | type |
|-------|------|
| `items` | `map` |

## Invoke

```
ship ops call agents.permission_presets --json '{}'
```

Kind: read.

## Example response

```json
{
  "items": [
    {
      "id": "standard",
      "label": "Standard",
      "description": "Read + write within the workspace."
    },
    {
      "id": "readonly",
      "label": "Read-only",
      "description": "Read access only — no writes."
    },
    {
      "id": "elevated",
      "label": "Elevated",
      "description": "Includes network and system calls."
    }
  ]
}
```
